 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OqzwUO8vktcQ7kNvwFCukuX&_nc_oc=AdrEMPJBSzdRZOPZJFX7lMfKmnVuX6yYGBfUDNhzXRdLRDLG-QMIT9QBnhlTWoWVGcg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQROHUcIEsMI3otsg6MlOFD3oiXH39e1KPzoRVcFhM4g7w&oe=6AF87BC1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7MgvV67YbVQQ7kNvwEGpDmm&_nc_oc=AdpDhOfsNUU264E-kw88F06l0AVqb4WXarZt4maM2pRhlUBEtopXY6CBl4ozapRbxfI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQU4KeQI5nCg5kCBTHoHfNgjeDFY-69SG00jxWX5RttIg&oe=6AF88926"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1ULfcEp4GdcQ7kNvwFCfmRW&_nc_oc=AdoSg2IvA94kbR6ieWes78UBF7KsrgAt2kYpbfwKXcWdCEmeIEoMwS2YhWQQjmrZ3JI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSSwxUmV__54CgQsKiXKHb8cn2Ls5fPjNFNMiQxK5-LYw&oe=6AF8931C"}, {"fil